# ============================================
# ApexQuant V2 — Multi-symbol State
# ============================================
# NOTE: `state.json` is blocked globally above. Both V1 and V2 workflows
# MUST force-add it (`git add -f`) because it is the runtime state that
# must persist across runs.
#
# Only backups are permanently blocked here — they accumulate rapidly
# (one per save_state_v2() call, ~10 per cycle) and would bloat the repo.
multi_symbol_state_dir/state.json.bak.*